      "title": "Frontend",
      "items": [
        "React 19 + TypeScript + Vite inside the Tauri webview",
        "RTK Query caches every command via tauriBaseQuery → invoke()",
        "6-locale i18n (en/ja/zh/ko/es/fr)"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "emerald",
      "title": "Rust core",
      "items": [
        "58 commands registered in generate_handler! (lib.rs), plus one debug-only command",
        "Handlers grouped by domain under src-tauri/src/handlers/",
        "JSON stores go through multi-process safe locked_json, not tauri-plugin-store"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "amber",
      "title": "External processes",
      "items": [
        "ffmpeg spawned with CREATE_NO_WINDOW on Windows",
        "ffmpeg binary downloaded on demand into the lib dir and validated before use"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "violet",
      "title": "Updates",
      "items": [
        "tauri-plugin-updater checks GitHub Releases",
        "Release notes and star count via github.rs (GitHub API)"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "rose",
      "title": "Trust & session",
      "items": [
        "Bilibili cookies kept in an in-memory cache; session persisted to login_state.json",
        "ERR::UNAUTHORIZED auto-logs-out the UI (invokeErrorHandler)"
      ]
    }
